row 2 four clearly distinct movement poses: alternating walking/crawling stride or flight wingbeat appropriate to anatomy;
row 3 four combat poses: anticipation, stronger wind-up, forward strike/spell release, follow-through. Keep spell glows attached to body, no detached projectiles;
row 4 four reactions: light hit flinch, stronger hit recoil, weakened crouch/settling, peaceful resting/slumped defeat. Last two poses remain a single intact non-gory creature.
Make a cohesive loop for idle and movement, with identical outfit and consistent lighting in every frame.
